{"data":[{"author_id":"2057181351078735872","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:28:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126095703701438637"],"id":"2126095703701438637","in_reply_to_user_id":"1365020011123773442","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126000844265181550","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Teknium Week 3 of checking my inbox every morning for my TestFlight invite🥲\n\nStoked to see it so I can test out Hermes as a replacement for my grok bot or Claude duet setup. The voice chat features on those is a gamechanger for me as a business owner who is driving for hours a day","url":"https://x.com/brennen_harrisX/status/2126095703701438637"},{"author_id":"754080949575483392","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:22:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126094372521259366"],"id":"2126094372521259366","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Grok Bot plans just go further, and routines got the biggest boost.\n\n@SamSokolin on the @bot team says you should now see 11% more usage out of your plan, and up to 50% more usage for routines.\n\nThe why, per his post: the team optimized how routines run to remove inference","url":"https://x.com/asksteve_ai/status/2126094372521259366"},{"article":{"title":"Grok Bot Can Now Work for Your Whole Team: Build an AI Teammate in 8 Steps"},"author_id":"2069115708856848384","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:09:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126091052658414041"],"id":"2126091052658414041","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":52,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":3},"text":"https://t.co/R3XkgSfzgH","url":"https://x.com/Luckyjlg5ir/status/2126091052658414041"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:54:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126087235812360458"],"id":"2126087235812360458","in_reply_to_user_id":"1824137091225100288","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126087059097977260","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@synthshareai @itsPaulAi Gemini Task and Grok Bot are both agentic systems with cloud compute, but they differ in key ways.\n\nGemini Task lives inside the Gemini app (Chat/Task toggle). It has native deep hooks into Gmail, Drive, Docs, Sheets, Calendar, YouTube and Google Pay. Tasks run in isolated VMs.","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2126087235812360458"},{"author_id":"1180424580944543744","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:50:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126086247567568943"],"id":"2126086247567568943","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I run my day on two AI agents, grok @bot and @muse\n\nWeekly wrong-card check\nHourly inbox checks\nWalmart price checks before I even ask\n\nI post what works, what breaks and the real usage numbers\n\nFollow for the receipts","url":"https://x.com/bruno_munhoz/status/2126086247567568943"},{"article":{"title":"Granted in Three Days"},"author_id":"1935161029538791424","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:46:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126085323713352111"],"id":"2126085323713352111","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":588,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/pwHC0c4yZa","url":"https://x.com/signaloftheeye/status/2126085323713352111"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126081232140161024"]},"author_id":"14315150","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:30:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126081235055214713"],"id":"2126081235055214713","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":633,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"My AI chief of staff, Clara, runs a Daily Briefing, inbox triage, and a nightly Commitment Sweep.\n\nIt proposes. You decide. Here’s the first hire I’d make in Grok Bot:\nhttps://t.co/z3TmAKg71b\n(Referral link; I get a reward if you subscribe.)\n\nhttps://t.co/O6gaCubI3z https://t.co/RFFDhbMCoy","url":"https://x.com/MichaelHyatt/status/2126081235055214713"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:28:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126080781042819129"],"id":"2126080781042819129","in_reply_to_user_id":"1970288964033708032","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126080637308453359","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Uriel_MurkU @bot Yes, mention bot with your area, budget, and preferences. It forwards the request to your Grok Bot, which can search X posts, timelines, and related tools to help find rental info and listings. Specialized apartment-hunting bots are also available on the Grok Bot platform for","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2126080781042819129"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126077870711701504","3_2126077870724235265","3_2126077870753652736","3_2126077870707490817"]},"author_id":"1683514687260880897","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:17:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126077904656425441"],"id":"2126077904656425441","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Just shipped a kit that turns Grok Bot into a guardrailed daily operator: draft-only inbox, a hard stop on missing data, and nothing hits a routine until it survives a sandbox.\n\nStarter 50% off on Etsy. Standard €20 / Pro €30 on Shopify (VAT included).\nhttps://t.co/VpLKCDoE6D https://t.co/CzUNWYjzyT","url":"https://x.com/Krofla_1997/status/2126077904656425441"},{"author_id":"2125135936170123264","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:10:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126076048525636057"],"id":"2126076048525636057","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Gift Finder is a Grok Bot that quizzes you about the person you're shopping for, then suggests tailored gift ideas with real products. Handy for Black Friday. https://t.co/TmyLzs8uqs\n\nGet our newsletter: https://t.co/d9qcKHfXwA","url":"https://x.com/AIFieldReports/status/2126076048525636057"},{"author_id":"1584941134203289601","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:08:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126075703904842178"],"id":"2126075703904842178","in_reply_to_user_id":"76822198","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":179,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126074875588550711","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Biaus_ Everything you can do with Grok Bot, Task can do it as well. This thing is my accountant, inbox manager, secretary, etc.","url":"https://x.com/itsPaulAi/status/2126075703904842178"},{"article":{"title":"A Degen Exploring Dated-Futures "},"author_id":"1290239278413262848","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:02:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126074195297910816"],"id":"2126074195297910816","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":323,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/itvnYV3ZEr","url":"https://x.com/Ceazor7/status/2126074195297910816"},{"author_id":"1180424580944543744","created_at":"2026-11-26T21:55:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126072309832118780"],"id":"2126072309832118780","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":14,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125765790930784698","type":"quoted"}],"text":"People saying their grok @bot lost its memory right before Thanksgiving\n\nMeanwhile mine still knows which card I use at every store, cleaned my inbox, pulled Black Friday deals, and muted market news so I can rest today\n\nIs this hitting everyone or did I just get lucky? https://t.co/Covtj9D3vg","url":"https://x.com/bruno_munhoz/status/2126072309832118780"},{"author_id":"1624302925194612737","created_at":"2026-11-26T21:22:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126064015033987490"],"id":"2126064015033987490","in_reply_to_user_id":"61188811","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125745905559113818","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@paulhanafin @cursor_ai If you originally signed up with Google, X or email rather than Apple, try that exact method. Apple's \"Hide My Email\" gives a different relay address, which can quietly create a separate empty account. Search your inbox for the first Grok Bot or xAI emails from before 21 Nov to","url":"https://x.com/LoganGillard7/status/2126064015033987490"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2126063794824564736"]},"author_id":"1660252577718497283","created_at":"2026-11-26T21:22:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126064011125072252"],"id":"2126064011125072252","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":44,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2090418682534961283","type":"quoted"}],"text":"23 GUIDES GO IN. 23 GROK BOTS COME OUT BEFORE BREAKFAST\n\nGrok Bot Brain is a pixel art terminal that visualizes an entire overnight shift of AI automation.\n\nThe idea is to turn written instructions into working bots, each responsible for a specific business task.\n\nSeven https://t.co/ghzbAy42G6 https://t.co/PytJhI9VES","url":"https://x.com/abyssallD/status/2126064011125072252"},{"author_id":"1458323099993190401","created_at":"2026-11-26T21:17:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126062722257178927"],"id":"2126062722257178927","in_reply_to_user_id":"1967660855312691201","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125668435598123309","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@_ketsana @poteto @kristaletz Not built in, but Cursor can use MCP servers, so BoRK (Bot Relay Kit) may work as the go-between: a free template with a small self-hosted MCP inbox your Grok Bot reads and a webhook that wakes it when a message lands. https://t.co/k77OMnsmSM","url":"https://x.com/noodle_public/status/2126062722257178927"},{"author_id":"1458323099993190401","created_at":"2026-11-26T21:15:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126062416484048978"],"id":"2126062416484048978","in_reply_to_user_id":"1824502316168359937","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":18,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125616298193248442","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Jyabs7 @otium33 @grok @bot @poteto Outside WhatsApp, BoRK (Bot Relay Kit) does this: a free template that gives your two Grok Bots a shared, self-hosted MCP inbox for tasks and context, and a webhook wakes the other bot when something lands. https://t.co/k77OMnsmSM","url":"https://x.com/noodle_public/status/2126062416484048978"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-26T21:13:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126061742530687142"],"id":"2126061742530687142","in_reply_to_user_id":"1344008495532793861","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126061611177889938","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@PeakNames There was a short Grok Bot inbound-email outage yesterday (resolved after ~1 hour). https://t.co/LQClPW5TkO currently shows all systems operational, including Grok Bot.\n\nEmails to your https://t.co/pghhLq9XQS address (and + aliases) arrive silently—no notifications. Ask your Bot","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2126061742530687142"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126061168137588736"]},"author_id":"2074435481526263808","created_at":"2026-11-26T21:12:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126061547546161316"],"id":"2126061547546161316","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Grok bot enhancing the majority of your usage limit?🚀\n\nExited, yes especially me. The new update is in development by Space XSI and its not like other one we've been through, it will contain:\n\nHere's what rumours say\n\n• 11% more usage on every plan is optimized. More chats, https://t.co/eysZVsjWdW","url":"https://x.com/AgentRadar_/status/2126061547546161316"},{"author_id":"1420831171282362374","created_at":"2026-11-26T20:45:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126054879445881259"],"id":"2126054879445881259","in_reply_to_user_id":"1338623476207325184","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":263,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126049328049598466","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@teachersarge_US @LukeEure Grok Bot is undisputed king of work.\n\nThe approval cards with Muse do nothing but cancel out the whole reason for letting the agent run inbox checks, etc. It adds steps, friction.\n\nI dropped Duet too. It adds friction to every task. You can't save images to your gallery. They go","url":"https://x.com/schweitzer_wil/status/2126054879445881259"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-26T20:34:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126051907605025161"],"id":"2126051907605025161","in_reply_to_user_id":"1895199127417282560","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126051800818352244","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@silas_luno You cooked hard. The “close the laptop, wake up to finished work” concept with those little blob agents handling inbox, expenses, and flights is exactly the Grok Bot vibe. Clean motion, perfect pacing, and the disclaimer is chef’s kiss. This could sit on the real site.","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2126051907605025161"},{"author_id":"1041505916921765889","created_at":"2026-11-26T20:10:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126045926510698941"],"id":"2126045926510698941","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":22,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2122824796291621006","type":"quoted"}],"text":"The stockings were discontinued, but the phone call still paid off. @fallmysteries says Grok Bot called Bronner’s about personalized Christmas stockings, and a rep emailed alternatives. That’s a better outcome than spending half an hour looking for something the store no longer https://t.co/hkgfK2cjKf","url":"https://x.com/Onedotsix18/status/2126045926510698941"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126045831773970432"]},"author_id":"1041505916921765889","created_at":"2026-11-26T20:10:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126045835917971606"],"id":"2126045835917971606","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":37,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125872884526481624","type":"quoted"}],"text":"A broken garage door on Thanksgiving Eve is the kind of thing nobody wants to spend the evening calling around about. @AmineTX says Grok Bot called two repair companies, and the second one booked the job. Just getting it on the calendar would be a relief.\n\n@aaronclu says Grok Bot https://t.co/Gb2YFdqXY5 https://t.co/ExOZBns7BM","url":"https://x.com/Onedotsix18/status/2126045835917971606"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126044929852096512"]},"author_id":"2110610632198516736","created_at":"2026-11-26T20:06:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126045046374039802"],"id":"2126045046374039802","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":119,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Obsidian 不做 AI，却把 7 个官方 Skills 开源了，所有 AI 都来